{"id":"01a0657e-01bc-7368-b72f-35caa635b4c0","chapterSlug":"rw7-10 K","paragraph":283,"wording":"[Blacksmith]","event":"named","holderSlug":"nawalishifra","holderQuote":"He looked at Nawal. She caught herself—even her awe over the King of Destruction couldn’t diminish her pride as a [Blacksmith]."}
